<title>INDIA: Dunlop India 96/97 net 51.4 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Dunlop India 96/97 net 51.4 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyre-maker Dunlop India Ltd on Monday announced net profit of 51.4 million rupees and a dividend of 10 percent for 1996/97 (April-March), the Press Trust of India (PTI) said.</p>
<p>The company's turnover in the year was 5.63 billion rupees, the news agency said. It gave no comparative figures.  </p>
<p>The company's board noted that profits were lower than expected because of limitations obtaining working capital, high raw material prices and environmental restrictions.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
